  "description": "*From [INKR Comics](https://comics.inkr.com/title/1257-painful-dating):*    \nThe timid Na Jiwoo wants to break up with his scary girlfriend, so he lied about joining the army.  \nAfter that, he gets a part-time job, but as if by fate, his co-worker is his girlfriend's roommate.  \nJiwoo must now hide his identity in front of his girlfriend while his co-worker is crushing on him.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=8530118), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000052790), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/painful_love)\n\n**Official Translations:**     \nEnglish ([Dashtoon](https://dashtoon.com/comics/read/SHOkOFeXuNGrPzoiKZS), [HyperComic](https://play.hypercomic.io/Webtoon/episode/70/), [MangaPlaza](https://mangaplaza.com/title/0303011514/)), [Japanese](https://www.amazon.co.jp/-/en/dp/B0BTJFFN95/)",
